    SupervisoryStation -->|"CONN-04: System C2 Datalink [PORT_SUP_C2 -> PORT_CTRL_C2]"| SystemController
    SensorFusion -->|"CONN-05: Sensor State Estimates [PORT_SENS_DATA -> PORT_CTRL_TLM]"| SystemController
