    SystemController -->|"CONN-07: Safety Heartbeat & State [PORT_CTRL_CMD -> PORT_WD_IN]"| SafetyWatchdog
    SupportEquipment -.->|"CONN-08: Auxiliary Power & Diagnostics [PORT_SUPP_PWR]"| SystemController
